  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"se-viewer se-theme-default\" lang=\"ko-KR\">\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_START -->\n    <!--@CONTENTS_HEADER-->\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_END -->\n    <div class=\"se-main-container\">\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-ffad73fa-5142-4828-8caa-31435e2ec849\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-98c26645-a666-4612-a4ec-d15883468523\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f8766fb9-61d2-445e-910e-9c14e86874be\">오늘 우연히 저에 대해 안좋게 적은 글을 봤습니다. 원래 저는 이런 글에 쉽게 힘들어 하는 성격인데 오늘은 오히려 힘이 생겼습니다. 내용도 다 말도 안되는 이야기만 적혀있었지만, 이런 댓글이 있더라구요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-06e19f8d-01cc-428f-a334-dd0b3c09cd73\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-bef11048-dd99-4076-9d04-d9e08f326775\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-abbe678c-b86a-4857-8feb-d2c738f373fb\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a9ddab33-2793-4410-80ae-1b2256d6616b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-282568c7-1364-406e-ba4a-90e618617d96\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f1b86a91-620c-4242-9a4f-c4d55a692480\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-13a35c67-c1be-471c-8f9d-54fa51662061\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4e99aa12-3ee4-4aa1-9b3f-f860ea8733bb\">&quot;주는사란은 찐이예요&quot;</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b7eaa53e-e48b-4978-9cee-1313d5a997a7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-6d1d4c73-0ab2-4f7a-a94b-765b291eec20\">&quot;수강생인데, 저 사람은 진심이 느껴져요&quot;</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7d7c9e94-506e-462f-a508-712ad85be3e6\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-70c9e3d9-e56e-47ba-82f8-0dc72870b2e9\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4bd802d5-b01e-474a-a32a-3f82b9545915\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7762af16-073a-4abb-a251-6dd5d76a42b0\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-875df635-0356-4f7d-91b5-cbed38369144\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-8ea14dd6-2cc5-42f5-8811-fc18190236a4\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6193f5f9-1d0c-49d6-aa99-7dc57632a81b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-973daf32-02de-4b45-8f97-82a62c6631ff\">그 댓글 아래에는 이런 답글이 있더라구요. &quot;너 주는사란이냐?ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ&quot; </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e5ce8409-8d96-42a2-9aa2-605c9c0acbc4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-0f25f8f3-9df0-4ab8-9388-8e4caf22b4b5\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-83a9a1c1-d637-47e8-b95e-6a4ca6c50f3f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-802bde3e-611e-43aa-bc53-efaf3dcf2768\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-63ab1bfb-4660-47c4-b6ea-9dd678b05355\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-deb6d720-9a41-42c3-93dd-f4b3422c11d3\">뭔가 인생을 살면서 진심이 제대로 전달되었다는 느낌을 거의 처음 받아본 것 같아요. 그래서 너무 행복했어요. 어떤 분인지 모르지만 두분 진심으로 감사합니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-079adb74-4915-4b66-a958-3119d838ee92\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-e784e6ce-9a84-4bfa-9f9e-091dbaf8fb81\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-57bb21e5-fee8-46fc-958e-a316b03b81bd\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-8863a43f-1341-4d4a-938a-414db9db1817\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f1bac96f-b383-421d-beb6-9f01b3f12b92\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f898acc5-de41-45a2-b634-1ad99d13c158\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fc1faa9a-49b6-46c9-a55f-e0f3a79160f1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-dcf88b47-9130-40a1-9368-2b807eb876fa\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8e6ad520-3c9e-4bee-88b1-b274992c4c55\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-6eb27253-f583-489d-b2a9-ab239e3264e7\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-64d243da-0b06-4301-b6a5-b88cf1c01190\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f4b1e950-fca4-49be-9384-69420732257d\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-89dcf05e-6d94-4851-9dce-55202a6558df\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-365e2e2d-e055-43ae-a968-b78a018d865b\">유튜브를 하다보면 억울할 때가 많아요. 분명 영상에서 말 한 내용인데 왜 설명 안했냐고 제대로 보지도 않고 욕하는 사람도 있구요. 내 의도를 잘못 파악하고 확대해석해서 욕하는 사람도 있습니다. 정보를 더 자세히 알려줘야만 한다는 식으로 반협박 하는 사람도 있구요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1871fb87-bbd7-42a2-b9be-aea186ee9a2f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-b66981aa-24e4-43c8-b70d-b96ccf279115\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ff58e79a-971d-46e1-9998-19836d51a0fe\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-ac191d74-b0e2-49cb-bbad-a3b150806fa8\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c6471b22-1a7c-409d-af1a-f1caa10860cc\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-9b2829db-fcfa-4d80-ade7-dd5c42d0051e\">처음에는 이런 사람들을 보면 황당했어요. 화도 났구요. 그 다음에는 &quot;내가 이런 사람들까지 품어야 진짜가 되는거지&quot; 라는 생각에 정성스럽게 답글을 다 달고 더 피드백을 하기도 했어요. 근데 이런 사람들은 끝이 없더라구요. 그리고 1년이 된 지금은 내 가치를 알아주는 사람에게만 최선을 다하자는 생각입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-dc18a499-29f0-4266-874c-3c23993a4746\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-a2581013-6c03-41ae-b700-d0fa106dff0b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5e4b4354-ba6b-448a-8823-296d33495b68\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-d594cc3a-3890-43cd-bb92-b78ab8cdf5db\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-271c6a26-bbab-4dea-a406-f996bb375618\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-d48cb214-59c0-4873-bf97-c70e6182ce5d\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8be4ed62-d608-449a-a1d5-06be085a8403\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-e84fdc89-9357-41aa-ad35-6b97be1c34ec\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-89dbc2f5-f3e5-4e56-af2d-813e38990b52\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-cb11bced-8999-4680-96d3-66b936caccc5\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9e135640-5a39-4d14-adb8-971d39be0839\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-55c13107-9002-448e-ae43-0ba3e2986eb2\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8bd9dc9a-4d14-491c-bdc0-be47df6c054c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-70c85f3f-6c8d-4018-bfc3-8d8e9f301170\">검이불루 화이불치</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-820b174c-5426-4bc4-a3df-635d46da38ba\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-11a8fa9b-f94a-42ba-90cc-efaf5190bfe4\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-054dfc2a-37d7-488d-8105-1d2885db77e9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-8e105f0c-c7c5-4175-871c-ea015f9c4f28\">검소하나 누추하지 않고, 화려하나 사치스럽지 않게 사려구요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-83c7a539-37bd-4524-8ba3-4316ed71b7a3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-29783263-de28-48f9-9dc5-9f952bd71941\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3bae4ae1-93e2-40e8-92d1-a95514546c69\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-4e5d5c4c-440a-40b2-b064-2243eabf6c37\">알려졌으나 유명하지 않고, 자랑스러우나 으스대지 않고 사려구요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-dd2dd224-5a93-4356-90b6-38d149db77a5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-168ff493-d47f-4e18-b8be-059b116c5c54\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b14a75d2-6511-4ae1-9220-83747cca1718\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-7870408d-43cb-41a7-a991-a8a6e3cf4fd3\">최선을 다하나 오바하지 않고, 진심을 전하나 부담스럼게 하지 않으려구요. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3b8770ea-a09d-42bf-b8da-83d6c938c8c0\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-e42d253f-b6fd-4e65-9ed3-a0bbd623354f\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-19786a3d-5796-4435-99a0-dd186b6c06a5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-29e218cb-957b-405a-87c2-b018fcbcb8d8\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9081e783-e811-483d-b2cf-a31253d3b3ab\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-d0de69f7-0da3-4c18-af0b-05d407b8a371\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b15fac3f-8072-4ca2-81b0-77c4fe5aec00\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-ba856220-ad57-44d3-b86f-2dd5cad5733e\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9a0acf8a-9fa4-4f13-929b-39bc44b96cd5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-f48c43e7-7c89-48aa-a3a3-073685e5d060\">그렇게 살기로 마음먹은지 얼마 안됐는데.... 이미 제 마음을 알아주신 그 두분이 있어 너무 행복한 하루였습니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-269f11fd-13bd-4d52-97b6-561e9dc37214\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-   \" id=\"SE-60649e00-49c0-486b-9d1c-554aaf5db18b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-54db6d44-4a34-4b44-80fd-96de59849c16\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-extend\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" >\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-54db6d44-4a34-4b44-80fd-96de59849c16\", \"src\" : \"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDA1MDFfMTAg/MDAxNzE0NTY5MDM3MTg2.0H3dwXBbcs6-iERVNX24U-79ta5DLZCLlGJmrlJvvGQg.gQ54knFKVVI0IM8_zb6as-LBZ4XRPLcLVEe_aG6p-a4g.PNG/image.png\", \"originalWidth\" : \"1600\", \"originalHeight\" : \"1200\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://cafeptthumb-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNDA1MDFfMTAg/MDAxNzE0NTY5MDM3MTg2.0H3dwXBbcs6-iERVNX24U-79ta5DLZCLlGJmrlJvvGQg.gQ54knFKVVI0IM8_zb6as-LBZ4XRPLcLVEe_aG6p-a4g.PNG/image.png?type=w800\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-f794d99c-41fb-4d5f-991d-6d82d8fe62d2\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4